<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

	<!--
		The giant primitive bow can be made at a vanilla crafting spot, not only at a workbench.

		Gating, which is why this is its own folder: the giant weapons are not a Big and Small - Races or Weapons def.
		Big and Small - Genes &amp; More defines them, inside a Conditional/AnyContentMod folder its own LoadFolders only
		loads when at least one Big and Small content mod is active. This folder mirrors that list exactly, which is
		wider than the six mods the original checked for.
		Verified against Genes &amp; More 1.6: the bow has a recipeMaker and no recipeUsers list yet, so the add creates
		one. recipeUsers is additive, so this does not take the recipe away from any bench that already offers it.
	-->
	<Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
		<xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="BS_GiantPrimitiveBow"]/recipeMaker</xpath>
		<value>
			<recipeUsers>
				<li>CraftingSpot</li>
			</recipeUsers>
		</value>
	</Operation>

</Patch>
